SUMMARY:Pollinator Pitstop Workday (Charlotte)
DESCRIPTION:On this date\, Central Carolinas Master Naturalists and the North Carolina Wildlife Stewards Charlotte Chapter return to lead another volunteer workday at the Veteran’s Park Pollinator Pitstop\, located just down from the Carolina Panthers Fitness Court. We will accomplish installation of new plants and continue removing weeds from the pollinator garden! Please bring your favorite pair of gardening gloves and\, if you have one\, your favorite weeding tool – some tools may be available.  \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/pollinator-pitstop-workday-charlotte/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
