SUMMARY:Squawk\, Rattle\, and Howl! (Columbia)
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever wondered what animal is making the interesting sound you’re hearing outside? Join NCWF\, Pocosin Lakes National Wildlife Refuge\, and Pocosin Arts School of Fine Craft as we explore the variety of wildlife noises one might hear while enjoying nature in northeastern NC. Inspired by the unique species and sounds we’ll learn about\, youth and adult participants alike will have the opportunity to create their own handmade instruments out of clay! \nPieces will need to be fired back at the studio so participants will be able to pick up their clay instruments at the next art and nature collaboration on Wednesday\, December 9th. \nRegistration is required for this free program. Please reserve your spot at https://pocosinarts.org/event/squawk-rattle-howl/.
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/squawk-rattle-and-howl-columbia/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
