SUMMARY:Creek ReLeaf Tree Prep (Charlotte)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF\, Charlotte Public Tree Fund and Charlotte-Mecklenburg Stormwater to help prepare the site along Long Creek Greenway for the annual Creek ReLeaf tree planting event. Volunteers are needed to load/unload trees\, mix up tree species\, and deliver them to their respective zone locations throughout the site. Expect to walk along the creek corridor while unloading and staging trees. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/creek-releaf-tree-prep-charlotte/
CATEGORIES:Featured
