SUMMARY:Great Coharie River Research Symposium (Clinton)
DESCRIPTION:Join the Coharie Tribe and NCWF for a day of presentations uncovering the history of the Great Coharie River and ongoing research into its resilience for the future. Speakers from the Coharie Tribe\, Duke University\, NCSU\, DEQ\, App State\, and Tetra Tech will share their research and outline the future for community-centered indigenous-academic partnerships in the Great Coharie River watershed. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/great-coharie-river-research-symposium-clinton/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/GCRRSymposium1.jpg
END:VEVENT
